  "title": "Liv EZ Named Best Home Technology Product at IBS 2026",
  "summary": "The National Association of Home Builders (NAHB) named the winners of its 13th annual Best of IBS™ Awards during the NAHB International Builders’ Show® (IBS) in Orlando. The awards were presented during a ceremony held on the final day of the show. The Elkay Liv EZ residential water dispenser won the award for Best Home Technology Product.",
